# 메인 홈 카드: 나만의 색 → 지금 방송 중 → 오늘의 팁 → 날짜·인사 (마지막, ✕ 없음)
import sys

PATH = "lib/screens/home_screen.dart"
MARK = "_buildHomeCard(isDarkMode), // 나만의 색 → 지금 방송 → 오늘의 팁 → 날짜·인사"

METHODS = "  // ───── 메인 홈 카드: 나만의 색 → 지금 방송 → 오늘의 팁 → 날짜·인사 (마지막, 안 닫힘) ─────\n  Set<String> _homeClosed = {}; // 오늘 ✕로 닫은 카드 ('radio', 'tip')\n  bool _favProgramAsked = false; // 즐겨찾기 방송 편성표는 한 번만 받기\n\n  static String _homeDay(DateTime d) =>\n      '${d.year}${d.month.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}${d.day.toString().padLeft(2, '0')}';\n\n  Future<void> _loadHomeClosed() async {\n    final p = await SharedPreferences.getInstance();\n    final today = p.getString('main_card_closed_day') == _homeDay(DateTime.now());\n    final list = today ? (p.getStringList('main_card_closed') ?? const <String>[]) : const <String>[];\n    if (mounted) setState(() => _homeClosed = list.toSet());\n  }\n\n  /// ✕ → 오늘은 닫고 바로 다음 카드 (내일 다시 처음부터)\n  Future<void> _closeHomeCard(String key) async {\n    const MethodChannel('kr.ssing.catsong/media').invokeMethod('vibrate');\n    setState(() => _homeClosed = {..._homeClosed, key});\n    final p = await SharedPreferences.getInstance();\n    await p.setString('main_card_closed_day', _homeDay(DateTime.now()));\n    await p.setStringList('main_card_closed', _homeClosed.toList());\n  }\n\n  /// 즐겨찾기 방송의 지금 프로그램 받아 오기 (편성표 있는 국내 방송만)\n  void _askFavProgram(RadioProvider radio, RadioStation s) {\n    if (_favProgramAsked) return;\n    _favProgramAsked = true;\n    final n = s.name;\n    WidgetsBinding.instance.addPostFrameCallback((_) {\n      try {\n        if (n == 'MBC 표준FM' || n == 'MBC FM4U') {\n          radio.fetchMbcSchedule(n);\n        } else if (n == 'SBS 파워FM' || n == 'SBS 러브FM') {\n          radio.fetchSbsSchedule(n);\n        } else if (n == 'CBS 음악FM' || n == 'CBS 표준FM') {\n          radio.fetchJsonSchedule(n);\n        } else if (s.streamUrl.contains('cfpwwwapi.kbs.co.kr')) {\n          radio.fetchScheduleByUrl(n, s.streamUrl);\n        }\n      } catch (_) {}\n    });\n  }\n\n  // 메인 홈 팁 (음악 탭 TIP과 안 겹치게 음악 말고 다른 기능만)\n  static const _mainTips = <(String, String, String, String)>[\n    ('바탕화면 위젯을 놓아 보세요', '바탕화면을 꾹 → 위젯 → 파란소리', 'Add the home screen widget', 'Long-press home screen → Widgets'),\n    ('아침 알람으로 깨워 드려요', '음악·라디오·자연 소리로 일어나요', 'Wake up with Paransori', 'Music, radio or nature sounds'),\n    ('원하는 시간에 라디오 켜기', '라디오 재생 화면 아래 [예약]', 'Schedule the radio', 'Tap Schedule under the radio player'),\n    ('TV·스피커로 소리 보내기', '같은 Wi-Fi라면 재생 화면 ⋮ 메뉴에서', 'Play on your TV or speaker', 'Same Wi-Fi → player ⋮ menu'),\n    ('잠들 땐 수면 타이머', '재생 화면 아래 [수면]을 눌러요', 'Sleep timer for bedtime', 'Tap Sleep under the player'),\n  ];\n\n  Widget _buildHomeCard(bool isDark) {\n    // ① 나만의 색 (나오는 조건은 예전 그대로)\n    if (_showColorTip) return _buildColorTip(isDark);\n    final isKo = Localizations.localeOf(context).languageCode == 'ko';\n    final card = isDark ? const Color(0xFF32302C) : const Color(0xFFFBF8F2);\n    final now = DateTime.now();\n    final day = DateTime(now.year, now.month, now.day).difference(DateTime(2024, 1, 1)).inDays;\n\n    // ② 지금 방송 중 (즐겨찾기 라디오가 있을 때만)\n    final radio = context.watch<RadioProvider>();\n    if (!_homeClosed.contains('radio') && radio.favorites.isNotEmpty) {\n      final s = radio.favorites.firstWhere((f) => f.countryCode == 'KR', orElse: () => radio.favorites.first);\n      _askFavProgram(radio, s);\n      final p = radio.currentProgramFor(s.name);\n      final prog = (radio.nowPlayingFor(s.name) ?? p?['program_title'] ?? p?['title'] ?? '').toString().trim();\n      return _homeInfoCard(\n        isDark: isDark,\n        lead: _LiveBadge(hole: card),\n        label: prog.isNotEmpty ? (isKo ? '지금 방송 중' : 'ON AIR') : (isKo ? '즐겨찾는 방송' : 'FAVORITE RADIO'),\n        title: prog.isNotEmpty ? prog : s.name,\n        sub: prog.isNotEmpty ? s.name : (isKo ? '지금 바로 들어 보세요' : 'Listen right now'),\n        action: isKo ? '듣기' : 'Play',\n        onAction: () => Navigator.push(\n          context,\n          MaterialPageRoute(builder: (_) => RadioPlayerScreen(station: s, openedFromList: false)),\n        ),\n        onClose: () => _closeHomeCard('radio'),\n      );\n    }\n\n    // ③ 오늘의 팁 (하루에 하나씩)\n    if (!_homeClosed.contains('tip')) {\n      final i = day % _mainTips.length;\n      final t = _mainTips[i];\n      return _homeInfoCard(\n        isDark: isDark,\n        lead: _TipBadge(hole: card),\n        label: isKo ? '오늘의 팁' : 'TIP',\n        title: isKo ? t.$1 : t.$3,\n        sub: isKo ? t.$2 : t.$4,\n        action: i == 1 ? (isKo ? '설정' : 'Set') : null,\n        onAction: i == 1\n            ? () => Navigator.push(context, MaterialPageRoute(builder: (_) => const AlarmScreen()))\n            : null,\n        onClose: () => _closeHomeCard('tip'),\n      );\n    }\n\n    // ④ 날짜 + 인사 (마지막 카드라 ✕ 없음)\n    final h = now.hour;\n    final slot = (h >= 5 && h < 11) ? 0 : (h >= 11 && h < 17) ? 1 : (h >= 17 && h < 21) ? 2 : 3;\n    const wk = ['월', '화', '수', '목', '금', '토', '일'];\n    const wkEn = ['Monday', 'Tuesday', 'Wednesday', 'Thursday', 'Friday', 'Saturday', 'Sunday'];\n    const mEn = ['Jan', 'Feb', 'Mar', 'Apr', 'May', 'Jun', 'Jul', 'Aug', 'Sep', 'Oct', 'Nov', 'Dec'];\n    const hello = ['좋은 아침이에요', '좋은 오후예요', '편안한 저녁이에요', '고요한 밤이에요'];\n    const helloEn = ['Good morning', 'Good afternoon', 'Good evening', 'Good night'];\n    const lines = ['오늘도 좋은 소리와 함께해요', '반가워요, 잠시 쉬어가요', '편안한 하루 되세요', '오늘 하루도 반가워요', '마음이 쉬어가는 곳, 파란소리'];\n    const linesEn = ['Welcome back', 'Good sounds, good day', 'Take a moment for yourself', 'Your sounds are waiting', 'Relax and listen'];\n    return _homeInfoCard(\n      isDark: isDark,\n      lead: _SkyBadge(slot: slot),\n      label: isKo ? '${now.month}월 ${now.day}일 ${wk[now.weekday - 1]}요일' : '${wkEn[now.weekday - 1]}, ${mEn[now.month - 1]} ${now.day}',\n      title: isKo ? hello[slot] : helloEn[slot],\n      sub: isKo ? lines[day % lines.length] : linesEn[day % linesEn.length],\n    );\n  }\n\n  /// 메인 홈 카드 모양 ('나만의 색' 카드와 같은 크기·글자·버튼)\n  Widget _homeInfoCard({\n    required bool isDark,\n    required Widget lead,\n    required String label,\n    required String title,\n    required String sub,\n    String? action,\n    VoidCallback? onAction,\n    VoidCallback? onClose,\n  }) {\n    final card = isDark ? const Color(0xFF32302C) : const Color(0xFFFBF8F2);\n    final ink = isDark ? const Color(0xFFF4EFE5) : const Color(0xFF17140F);\n    final subC = isDark ? const Color(0xFFA29A8B) : const Color(0xFF746C60);\n    final point = context.watch<ThemeProvider>().primaryColor;\n    final accent = _readable(\n        point.value == 0xFF2589E8\n            ? (isDark ? const Color(0xFF6FB0FF) : const Color(0xFF2F7DE8))\n            : point,\n        isDark);\n    return Container(\n      margin: const EdgeInsets.only(bottom: 16),\n      padding: EdgeInsets.fromLTRB(14, 10, onClose == null ? 14 : 4, 10),\n      decoration: BoxDecoration(\n        color: card,\n        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),\n        boxShadow: [\n          BoxShadow(\n            color: const Color(0xFF17140F).withOpacity(isDark ? 0.4 : 0.10),\n            blurRadius: 16,\n            spreadRadius: -3,\n            offset: const Offset(0, 6),\n          ),\n          BoxShadow(\n            color: const Color(0xFF17140F).withOpacity(0.05),\n            blurRadius: 3,\n            offset: const Offset(0, 1),\n          ),\n        ],\n      ),\n      child: Row(\n        children: [\n          Container(\n            width: 40,\n            height: 40,\n            decoration: BoxDecoration(\n              shape: BoxShape.circle,\n              boxShadow: [BoxShadow(color: Colors.black.withOpacity(0.15), blurRadius: 6, offset: const Offset(0, 2))],\n            ),\n            child: lead,\n          ),\n          const SizedBox(width: 12),\n          Expanded(\n            child: Column(\n              crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\n              mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,\n              children: [\n                Text(label,\n                    maxLines: 1,\n                    overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,\n                    style: TextStyle(color: accent, fontSize: 10, height: 1.1, fontWeight: FontWeight.w800, letterSpacing: 0.6)),\n                const SizedBox(height: 2),\n                Text(title,\n                    maxLines: 1,\n                    overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,\n                    style: TextStyle(color: ink, fontSize: 13.5, height: 1.15, fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),\n                const SizedBox(height: 3),\n                Text(sub,\n                    maxLines: 1,\n                    overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,\n                    style: TextStyle(color: subC, fontSize: 11.5, height: 1.15)),\n              ],\n            ),\n          ),\n          if (action != null && onAction != null) ...[\n            const SizedBox(width: 6),\n            GestureDetector(\n              onTap: () {\n                const MethodChannel('kr.ssing.catsong/media').invokeMethod('vibrate');\n                onAction();\n              },\n              child: Container(\n                padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 12, vertical: 7),\n                decoration: BoxDecoration(color: ink, borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(14)),\n                child: Text(action, style: TextStyle(color: card, fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: FontWeight.w700)),\n              ),\n            ),\n          ],\n          if (onClose != null)\n            IconButton(\n              onPressed: onClose,\n              icon: Icon(Icons.close_rounded, color: subC, size: 17),\n              padding: EdgeInsets.zero,\n              constraints: const BoxConstraints(minWidth: 34, minHeight: 34),\n            ),\n        ],\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n\n"
CLASSES = '\n// ───── 메인 홈 카드 왼쪽 동그라미 그림 ─────\n\n/// 날짜·인사: 시간대 하늘 (아침·낮·저녁·밤)\nclass _SkyBadge extends StatelessWidget {\n  final int slot; // 0 아침, 1 낮, 2 저녁, 3 밤\n  const _SkyBadge({required this.slot});\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    const skies = [\n      [Color(0xFFFFD9A8), Color(0xFFF7A27A), Color(0xFF8FB7E8)], // 아침: 해 뜨는 색\n      [Color(0xFFBFE3FA), Color(0xFF7DBDEB), Color(0xFF4A98DC)], // 낮: 맑은 하늘\n      [Color(0xFFF6C177), Color(0xFFE07A4F), Color(0xFF8A6FD1)], // 저녁: 노을\n      [Color(0xFF4A5BB0), Color(0xFF2C357A), Color(0xFF1C2350)], // 밤\n    ];\n    final night = slot == 3;\n    return Container(\n      decoration: BoxDecoration(\n        shape: BoxShape.circle,\n        gradient: LinearGradient(\n          begin: Alignment.topLeft,\n          end: Alignment.bottomRight,\n          colors: skies[slot],\n        ),\n      ),\n      alignment: Alignment(0, slot == 2 ? 0.35 : 0.1),\n      child: night\n          ? SizedBox(\n              width: 15,\n              height: 15,\n              child: Stack(children: [\n                Container(decoration: const BoxDecoration(shape: BoxShape.circle, color: Color(0xFFFFF3C4))),\n                Positioned(\n                  left: 5,\n                  top: -2,\n                  child: Container(\n                    width: 14,\n                    height: 14,\n                    decoration: const BoxDecoration(shape: BoxShape.circle, color: Color(0xFF2C357A)),\n                  ),\n                ),\n              ]),\n            )\n          : Container(\n              width: 15,\n              height: 15,\n              decoration: BoxDecoration(\n                shape: BoxShape.circle,\n                color: const Color(0xFFFFF6DC),\n                boxShadow: [BoxShadow(color: const Color(0xFFFFF0C8).withOpacity(0.9), blurRadius: 10, spreadRadius: 3)],\n              ),\n            ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n/// 지금 방송 중: 색 고리 + 빨간 점에서 전파가 퍼짐\nclass _LiveBadge extends StatefulWidget {\n  final Color hole;\n  const _LiveBadge({required this.hole});\n\n  @override\n  State<_LiveBadge> createState() => _LiveBadgeState();\n}\n\nclass _LiveBadgeState extends State<_LiveBadge> with SingleTickerProviderStateMixin {\n  late final AnimationController _c =\n      AnimationController(vsync: this, duration: const Duration(milliseconds: 2000))..repeat();\n\n  @override\n  void dispose() {\n    _c.dispose();\n    super.dispose();\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return AnimatedBuilder(\n      animation: _c,\n      builder: (_, __) => CustomPaint(painter: _LivePainter(hole: widget.hole, t: _c.value)),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass _LivePainter extends CustomPainter {\n  final Color hole;\n  final double t;\n  const _LivePainter({required this.hole, required this.t});\n\n  @override\n  void paint(Canvas canvas, Size size) {\n    final r = size.shortestSide / 2;\n    final c = size.center(Offset.zero);\n    final rect = Rect.fromCircle(center: c, radius: r);\n    canvas.drawCircle(\n        c,\n        r,\n        Paint()\n          ..shader = const SweepGradient(colors: [\n            Color(0xFFE07A4F),\n            Color(0xFFD46A8C),\n            Color(0xFF8A6FD1),\n            Color(0xFF3F51A3),\n            Color(0xFF1F9AA0),\n            Color(0xFFE07A4F),\n          ]).createShader(rect));\n    canvas.drawCircle(c, r - 4, Paint()..color = hole);\n    const red = Color(0xFFFF6B5E);\n    for (final d in [0.0, 0.5]) {\n      final k = (t + d) % 1.0;\n      canvas.drawCircle(\n          c,\n          4 + k * 9,\n          Paint()\n            ..style = PaintingStyle.stroke\n            ..strokeWidth = 2\n            ..color = red.withOpacity((1 - k) * 0.8));\n    }\n    canvas.drawCircle(c, 4, Paint()..color = red);\n  }\n\n  @override\n  bool shouldRepaint(covariant _LivePainter old) => old.t != t || old.hole != hole;\n}\n\n/// 오늘의 팁: 네 가지 색 고리 + 작은 네모 넷\nclass _TipBadge extends StatelessWidget {\n  final Color hole;\n  const _TipBadge({required this.hole});\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) => CustomPaint(painter: _TipPainter(hole: hole));\n}\n\nclass _TipPainter extends CustomPainter {\n  final Color hole;\n  const _TipPainter({required this.hole});\n\n  static const _colors = [Color(0xFF3E8E6A), Color(0xFFC4962C), Color(0xFFE07A4F), Color(0xFF2589E8)];\n\n  @override\n  void paint(Canvas canvas, Size size) {\n    final r = size.shortestSide / 2;\n    final c = size.center(Offset.zero);\n    final rect = Rect.fromCircle(center: c, radius: r);\n    const sweep = math.pi / 2;\n    for (var i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n      canvas.drawArc(rect, -math.pi / 2 + i * sweep, sweep + 0.01, true, Paint()..color = _colors[i]);\n    }\n    canvas.drawCircle(c, r - 4, Paint()..color = hole);\n    const s = 7.0, g = 2.0;\n    for (var i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n      final x = c.dx - s - g / 2 + (i % 2) * (s + g);\n      final y = c.dy - s - g / 2 + (i ~/ 2) * (s + g);\n      canvas.drawRRect(\n          RRect.fromRectAndRadius(Rect.fromLTWH(x, y, s, s), const Radius.circular(2)),\n          Paint()..color = _colors[i]);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @override\n  bool shouldRepaint(covariant _TipPainter old) => old.hole != hole;\n}\n'

EDITS = [
    ("홈 카드 자리 바꾸기",
     "          if (_showColorTip) _buildColorTip(isDarkMode),\n",
     "          " + MARK + "\n"),
    ("앱 켤 때 오늘 닫은 카드 불러오기",
     "    _loadRecentSearches();\n    WidgetGo.target.addListener(_onWidgetGo);",
     "    _loadRecentSearches();\n    _loadHomeClosed(); // 메인 홈 카드: 오늘 닫은 것\n    WidgetGo.target.addListener(_onWidgetGo);"),
    ("카드 기능 넣기",
     "  /// 크림 카드 + 색 고리 + 문구 + [바꾸기] + ✕",
     METHODS + "  /// 크림 카드 + 색 고리 + 문구 + [바꾸기] + ✕"),
]

try:
    raw = open(PATH, "rb").read().decode("utf-8")
except FileNotFoundError:
    print(f"❌ 파일이 없어요 ({PATH})")
    sys.exit(1)

crlf = "\r\n" in raw
text = raw.replace("\r\n", "\n")

if MARK in text and "class _SkyBadge" in text:
    print("이미 적용돼 있어요")
    sys.exit(0)

ok = True
for label, old, new in EDITS:
    if text.count(old) == 1:
        text = text.replace(old, new)
        print(f"✔ {label}")
    else:
        print(f"❌ {label} 못 찾음")
        ok = False

if "class _SkyBadge" not in text:
    text = text.rstrip("\n") + "\n" + CLASSES
    print("✔ 동그라미 그림(하늘·방송·팁) 넣기")

if text.count("(") != text.count(")") or text.count("{") != text.count("}") or text.count("[") != text.count("]"):
    print("❌ 괄호 짝이 안 맞아요")
    ok = False

if not ok:
    print("❌ 아무것도 저장 안 했어요.")
    sys.exit(1)

if crlf:
    text = text.replace("\n", "\r\n")
open(PATH, "wb").write(text.encode("utf-8"))
print("완료")
